1
00:00:00,820 --> 00:00:03,310
(Leonard:)Keep going, buddy. You're doing great.

2
00:00:04,023 --> 00:00:07,153
(Amy:)Sheldon, I'm your girlfriend
and you should have taken my side.

3
00:00:07,326 --> 00:00:10,786
(Amy:)That's it. End of story. Good night.

4
00:00:12,031 --> 00:00:16,991
(Sheldon:)Wow, Amy's mad and Leonard was right.

5
00:00:17,169 --> 00:00:19,159
(Sheldon:)What a weird day.

6
00:00:21,607 --> 00:00:24,167
(Penny:)Hey, sorry this took so long.
But you used to work here.

7
00:00:24,343 --> 00:00:27,003
(Penny:)- You know how it is.
- Kitchen slammed again?

8
00:00:27,179 --> 00:00:29,339
(Penny:)No, I'm a terrible waitress, remember?

9
00:00:31,183 --> 00:00:33,413
So anything I can do
to help you move tomorrow?

10
00:00:33,586 --> 00:00:37,856
(Howard:)Now that you mention it,
I was thinking tomorrow might not be great.

11
00:00:38,391 --> 00:00:41,021
- What's your excuse this time?
- No excuse.

12
00:00:41,193 --> 00:00:42,783
(Howard:)It's just, you know, I'm Jewish...

13
00:00:42,962 --> 00:00:46,862
(Howard:)...and technically, we're not supposed
to drive or carry anything on the Sabbath...

14
00:00:47,033 --> 00:00:48,863
(Howard:)...so this one's on God.

15
00:00:49,936 --> 00:00:54,206
That might be more convincing if you didn't
have a mouthful of bacon cheeseburger.

16
00:00:55,041 --> 00:00:57,631
My religion's kind of loosey-goosey,
you know.

17
00:00:57,843 --> 00:01:03,023
As long as you got your schmeckel
clipped and don't wear a cross, you're good.

